## Interface: 120000, 120001, 120005, 120007, 120100, 120105, 16001
## Title: |cff4cc9f0CludesUI|r Action Wheel
## Category: |cff4cc9f0Cludes|rUI
## Group: CludesUI
## Notes: Hold a keybind to open a menu of actions; point or scroll to choose, release to fire.
## Author: Cludes
## Version: 1.6.0
## Dependencies: CludesUI
## SavedVariables: CludesUIQuickdrawDB
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\CludesUI\media\eg-logo.tga

# Note: Bindings.xml (one binding per palette, routed to the secure buttons via
# SetOverrideBindingClick) is intentionally NOT listed here -- WoW auto-loads a
# file named Bindings.xml from the addon root, and listing it as well registers
# every <Binding> twice. Same reasoning as CludesUIActionBars.toc.
# The CUI_RADIAL binding ACTION names inside it predate the module's current
# name and stay for good: WoW stores keybinds against the action string, so
# renaming it would unbind every palette. Only the BINDING_HEADER/BINDING_NAME
# display strings carry the Quickdraw name.

# Main Lua
CludesUIQuickdraw.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Slots.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Actions.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_View.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Geometry.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Nests.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Advance.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Paint.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Pointer.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Live.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Secure.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Gates.lua
CUI_Quickdraw_Runtime.lua

